#: src/GuiEvents.cpp src/amule-remote-gui.cpp
msgid "Delete from disk"
msgstr "從磁碟刪除"

#: src/GuiEvents.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete '%s' from disk?\n"
"\n"
"File: %s\n"
"\n"
"The file is deleted and no longer shared. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"確定要從磁碟刪除「%s」嗎？\n"
"\n"
"檔案：%s\n"
"\n"
"檔案將被刪除並停止分享。這項操作無法復原。"

#: src/GuiEvents.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "... and %i more"
msgstr "……還有 %i 個"

#: src/GuiEvents.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete the selected %i files from disk?\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"The files are deleted and no longer shared. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"確定要從磁碟刪除選取的 %i 個檔案嗎？\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"這些檔案將被刪除並停止分享。這項操作無法復原。"

#: src/GuiEvents.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Could not delete these files from disk:\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"Remove them from shares and the completed transfer list anyway?\n"
"\n"
"Yes: stop sharing and remove the list entries. A later share scan may share the files again.\n"
"No: keep the files shared and listed."
msgstr ""
"無法從磁碟刪除下列檔案：\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"仍要停止分享並從已完成的傳輸清單移除嗎？\n"
"\n"
"是：停止分享並移除清單項目。下次掃描分享資料夾時，可能會再次分享這些檔案。\n"
"否：繼續分享並保留清單項目。"

