#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Sparse part files only occupy disk space for the parts already downloaded, so free space is used up gradually as the file fills in. Turn this off to use an ordinary file instead - useful where sparse files are unsupported or slow, or where backup/de-duplication tools handle them badly. Applies only when the core runs on Windows; on Linux and macOS part files are sparse anyway and this setting has no effect."
msgstr "稀疏的部分下載檔只會使用已下載分段所需的磁碟空間，可用空間會隨下載進度逐漸減少。可以關閉此選項以改用一般檔案，適合不支援稀疏檔案、使用稀疏檔案較慢，或備份與重複資料刪除工具無法妥善處理的情況。這項設定只適用於核心程式在 Windows 上執行時。在 Linux 和 macOS 上，部分下載檔一律使用稀疏檔案。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Stop downloads when free disk space reaches "
msgstr "可用磁碟空間降到以下大小時停止下載： "

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Select this if you want aMule to check your disk space"
msgstr "讓 aMule 檢查磁碟可用空間"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Enter here the min disk space desired."
msgstr "輸入要保留的最小可用磁碟空間。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Save up to 10 HighID sources of rare files (20 or fewer sources) on exit"
msgstr "結束時記下冷門檔案 (來源數不超過 20 個) 的 HighID 來源，最多 10 個"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "The saved sources are used again only if aMule restarts within 2 hours. LowID sources are not saved: a LowID only identifies a peer on the server that assigned it."
msgstr "只有在 2 小時內重新啟動 aMule，才會沿用已儲存的來源。LowID 來源不會儲存，因為 LowID 只在指派它的伺服器上才能識別這個對等端。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp src/Statistics.cpp
msgid "Uploads"
msgstr "上傳"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Add new shared files with auto priority"
msgstr "為新增的分享檔案自動設定優先等級"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Verify local data of requested shared files every"
msgstr "有人要求下載已分享的檔案時，依下列間隔驗證本機資料"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Re-read requested complete files in the background and compare them with their stored MD4/AICH hashes, as Verify Local Data does. Corrupt parts stop being shared. Uploads continue during the check."
msgstr "在背景重新讀取接到下載要求的完整檔案，比對已儲存的 MD4/AICH 雜湊值，做法與「驗證本機資料」相同。已損毀的分段會停止分享，檢查期間仍會繼續上傳。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "days (0 = off)"
msgstr "天 (0 表示關閉)"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Intelligent Corruption Handling (I.C.H.)"
msgstr "智慧損毀處理 (I.C.H.)"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "啟用"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Advanced I.C.H. trusts every hash (not recommended)"
msgstr "進階 I.C.H. 會信任所有雜湊值 (不建議)"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "File repair hashes over Kad"
msgstr "透過 Kad 使用檔案修復雜湊值"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Share and use file repair hashes (AICH) over Kad"
msgstr "透過 Kad 分享及使用檔案修復雜湊值 (AICH)"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid ""
"Share file repair hashes with other Kad nodes and learn them from Kad searches. These hashes can help aMule repair damaged download data without downloading an entire part again. aMule uses a hash for repair only once enough independent peers report the same one.\n"
"\n"
"Very old Kad clients (before eMule 0.49b) may miss search results containing these hashes. If you notice missing results, try turning this option off.\n"
"\n"
"Turning this option off discards the repair hashes stored in your Kad index on the next save. Turning it back on starts collecting them again.\n"
"\n"
"Technical detail: enabling this advertises Kad protocol version 0x0a and adds AICH hashes to keyword publish and search results."
msgstr ""
"向其他 Kad 節點分享檔案修復雜湊值，也可從 Kad 搜尋取得這些值。aMule 可用雜湊值修復損毀的下載資料，省去重新下載整個分段。只有在有足夠的獨立對等端回報相同的雜湊值時，aMule 才會使用它修復檔案。\n"
"\n"
"年代久遠的 Kad 用戶端 (早於 eMule 0.49b) 可能收不到含有這些雜湊值的搜尋結果。如果發現搜尋結果少了，請試著關閉這個選項。\n"
"\n"
"關閉這個選項後，下次儲存 Kad 索引時會捨棄其中的修復雜湊值。重新開啟後會再次收集。\n"
"\n"
"技術細節：啟用後會公布 Kad 協定版本 0x0a，並在發布關鍵字及搜尋結果時附上 AICH 雜湊值。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Ignore repair hashes from Kad nodes too old to support them"
msgstr "略過不支援修復雜湊值的舊版 Kad 節點傳來的雜湊值"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid ""
"Only applies when sharing and using file repair hashes over Kad is enabled. Ignore hashes published by nodes that report a Kad version too old to support them.\n"
"\n"
"A node's reported version may be out of date or inaccurate, so this can discard valid hashes and does not make accepted hashes trustworthy. Nodes whose version is unknown are still accepted.\n"
"\n"
"Technical detail: rejects AICH publish tags from nodes advertising Kad protocol versions below 0x09."
msgstr ""
"只有啟用透過 Kad 分享及使用檔案修復雜湊值時，這項設定才有效。若節點回報的 Kad 版本過舊、不支援修復雜湊值，就略過它發布的雜湊值。\n"
"\n"
"節點回報的版本可能過舊或不正確，因此可能會捨棄有效的雜湊值，通過篩選的雜湊值也不一定可信。仍會接受版本不明的節點所提供的雜湊值。\n"
"\n"
"技術細節：拒絕公布 Kad 協定版本低於 0x09 的節點所發布的 AICH 標籤。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Media metadata extraction"
msgstr "媒體中繼資料擷取"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Extract length / bitrate / codec from shared audio and video files"
msgstr "從分享的音訊與影片檔案擷取播放時間、位元速率和編解碼器資訊"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "When enabled, aMule uses its bundled media parser to extract metadata from shared media files."
msgstr "啟用後，aMule 會透過隨附的媒體解析程式擷取已分享媒體檔案的中繼資料。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid ""
"Completed downloads are stored here. All files in this folder are automatically shared with other peers.\n"
"If this folder also holds files you don't want to share, point it at an aMule-only sub-folder."
msgstr ""
"下載完成的檔案會儲存在這裡。這個資料夾中的所有檔案都會自動分享給其他對等端。\n"
"如果裡面有不想分享的檔案，請改用一個專供 aMule 使用的子資料夾。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Pick the folder where completed downloads will be stored. All files in that folder will be shared with other peers."
msgstr "選擇存放已完成下載的資料夾。裡面的所有檔案都會分享給其他對等端。"

