msgstr "按兩下可分享或停止分享這個資料夾。按右鍵可連同所有子資料夾一起分享，包括日後新增的子資料夾。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Bold: shared. Bold italic: shared with all subfolders. Red folder: contains shared folders."
msgstr "粗體：已分享。粗斜體：已連同所有子資料夾分享。紅色資料夾：內含已分享的資料夾。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Share hidden files"
msgstr "分享隱藏檔"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Automatically rescan shared folders for changes"
msgstr "自動重新掃描分享資料夾，查看有沒有變更"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Follow symbolic links in shared folders"
msgstr "在分享資料夾中跟隨符號連結"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Exclude files and folders matching:"
msgstr "排除符合下列條件的檔案和資料夾："

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Files and folders whose name matches are not shared. A matching folder inside a share that includes its subfolders is skipped with everything in it; a folder you share yourself is always shared. Matching is case-insensitive. As wildcards: patterns separated by '|', e.g. .DS_Store|Thumbs.db|*.tmp, where '*' matches any run of characters and '?' a single one. Tick the box below to write one regular expression instead."
msgstr "名稱符合條件的檔案和資料夾不會分享。若分享範圍包含子資料夾，符合條件的子資料夾及其所有內容都會略過。手動指定分享的資料夾一律會分享。比對時不分大小寫。使用萬用字元時，以「|」分隔比對式，例如 .DS_Store|Thumbs.db|*.tmp。「*」符合任意長度的字元，「?」符合單一字元。也可以勾選下方選項，改用一個規則運算式。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Patterns are regular expressions"
msgstr "使用規則運算式比對"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "When set, the whole field is one regular expression: '|' is alternation, and '*' and '?' take their regular-expression meaning rather than the wildcard one. When unset, it is a list of '|'-separated wildcards."
msgstr "勾選時，整個欄位視為一個規則運算式：「|」表示擇一，「*」和「?」依規則運算式的語法解讀。未勾選時，視為用「|」分隔的一組萬用字元比對式。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Show how many of the files and folders in your shared folders the current pattern would exclude, counted over the last scan."
msgstr "依上次掃描結果，顯示目前的比對式會排除分享資料夾內多少檔案和資料夾。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
