msgstr "背景服務允許遠端變更的資料夾"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "(Read-only. Configured on the daemon; if empty, the daemon refuses every remote folder change.)"
msgstr "(唯讀。請在背景服務中設定。若未設定，背景服務會拒絕所有遠端資料夾變更。)"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
