msgstr "支援協定混淆"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "This option enables Protocol Obfuscation for ed2k clients and servers, and makes aMule accept obfuscated connections. Kad UDP is always obfuscated, because the key that proves your address to a peer travels in the obfuscation header."
msgstr "開啟後，eD2k 用戶端與伺服器可使用協定混淆，aMule 也會接受經混淆的連線。Kad UDP 一律使用混淆，因為用來向對方證明位址的金鑰會放在混淆標頭中傳送。"

