msgstr ""
"無需設定。\n"
"\n"
"IP 對應國家資料由 DB-IP.com 提供 - https://db-ip.com\n"
"授權條款：Creative Commons BY 4.0 - https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"

