msgstr "啟動時檢查是否有新版 GeoIP 資料庫，aMule 執行期間每週再檢查一次。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Enable incoming message filtering (except current chat):"
msgstr "啟用來訊過濾 (目前的交談除外)："

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid ""
"Enable the filter options below. Select at least one option to filter messages.\n"
"Turning this off keeps your selected options and word list.\n"
"Filtered messages are discarded without opening a chat or replying to the sender."
msgstr ""
"開啟下方的過濾選項。請至少勾選一個選項，才會過濾訊息。\n"
"關閉時會保留已選取的選項和字詞清單。\n"
"符合過濾條件的訊息會直接捨棄，系統不會開啟交談或回覆寄件者。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Filter all messages"
msgstr "過濾所有訊息"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Filter messages from people not on your friend list"
msgstr "過濾來自好友以外的訊息"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Filter messages from unknown clients"
msgstr "過濾未知用戶端傳來的訊息"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Filter messages containing (use ',' as separator):"
msgstr "過濾包含下列字詞的訊息 (以「,」分隔)："

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid ""
"Discard chat messages containing any comma-separated term. Matching ignores case and spaces around each term.\n"
"Terms match anywhere in a message: dog matches hotdog and black dog spotted.\n"
"Wildcards are not supported. A * is literal, except that a word list of exactly * blocks every message."
msgstr ""
"來訊只要包含其中一個字詞就會捨棄。請用逗號分隔字詞，比對時不分大小寫，並會忽略字詞前後的空格。\n"
"字詞可出現在訊息中的任何位置，例如 dog 可比對到 hotdog 和 black dog spotted。\n"
"不支援萬用字元。* 會當成一般字元比對，但如果字詞清單只有一個 *，就會封鎖所有訊息。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Enable advanced spam filter"
msgstr "啟用進階垃圾訊息過濾"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Block unsolicited links and repeated messages from non-friends."
msgstr "封鎖好友以外的對象主動傳來的連結與重複訊息。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Require a CAPTCHA for first messages from non-friends"
msgstr "好友以外的對象首次傳送訊息時須通過 CAPTCHA 驗證"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Withhold the message until the sender solves the challenge. Clients without CAPTCHA support cannot start a chat."
msgstr "等寄件者通過驗證才會收到訊息。不支援 CAPTCHA 的用戶端無法開始交談。"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Show received messages in the log"
msgstr "記錄收到的訊息"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "File comments"
msgstr "檔案留言"

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid "Filter file comments containing (use ',' as separator):"
msgstr "過濾包含下列字詞的檔案留言 (以「,」分隔)："

#: src/muuli_wdr.cpp
msgid ""
"Hide file comments from other users containing any comma-separated term. This does not filter chat messages.\n"
"Matching ignores case and spaces around each term. Terms match anywhere in a comment: dog matches hotdog and black dog spotted.\n"
"Wildcards are not supported; * is matched literally."
msgstr ""
"其他使用者的檔案留言只要包含其中一個字詞就會隱藏。請用逗號分隔字詞。這項設定不會過濾交談訊息。\n"
"比對時不分大小寫，並會忽略字詞前後的空格。字詞可出現在留言中的任何位置，例如 dog 可比對到 hotdog 和 black dog spotted。\n"
"不支援萬用字元，* 會當成一般字元比對。"

