msgstr "已處理取得更多結果的要求，目前無法確認是否還有結果。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "More-results request processed; further requests remain possible.\n"
msgstr "已處理取得更多結果的要求，仍可再次要求。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "No further results can be requested for this search.\n"
msgstr "這項搜尋已無法要求更多結果。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Search stop request processed; retained results were not removed.\n"
msgstr "已處理停止搜尋的要求，原有的結果仍保留。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Number of search results: %i\n"
msgstr "搜尋結果筆數：%i\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Received an unknown reply from the server, OpCode = %#x."
msgstr "收到伺服器傳來的未知回覆，操作碼為 %#x。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Show short status information."
msgstr "顯示簡短狀態資訊。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Show connection status, current up/download speeds, etc.\n"
msgstr "顯示連線狀態、目前上傳下載速度等等。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Show full statistics tree."
msgstr "顯示完整的統計樹狀清單。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"Optionally, a number in the range 0-255 can be passed as an argument to this\n"
"command, which tells how many entries of the client version subtrees should be\n"
"shown. Passing 0 or omitting it means 'unlimited'.\n"
"\n"
"Example: 'statistics 5' will show only the top 5 versions for each client type.\n"
msgstr ""
"可指定 0 到 255 的整數，\n"
"用來限制各類用戶端要顯示的版本數。\n"
"輸入 0 或省略引數表示不限。\n"
"\n"
"例如 'statistics 5' 只會列出每類用戶端最常見的 5 個版本。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Shut down aMule."
msgstr "關閉 aMule。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"Shut down the remote running core (amule/amuled).\n"
"This will also shut down the text client, since it is unusable without a\n"
"running core.\n"
msgstr ""
"關閉遠端執行中的核心程式 (amule/amuled)。\n"
"文字介面用戶端需要核心程式才能運作，\n"
"因此也會一併關閉。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Reload the given object."
msgstr "重新載入指定的項目。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Reload shared files list."
msgstr "重新載入分享檔案清單。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Reload IP filtering table."
msgstr "重新載入 IP 過濾表。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Reload current IP filtering table."
msgstr "重新載入現用的 IP 過濾表。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Update IP filtering table from URL."
msgstr "從網址更新 IP 過濾表。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "If URL is omitted the URL from the preferences is used."
msgstr "若未指定網址，會使用偏好設定中的網址。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Connect to the network."
msgstr "連線到網路。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"This will connect to all networks that are enabled in Preferences.\n"
"You may also optionally specify a server address in IP:Port form, to connect to\n"
"that server only. The IP must be a dotted decimal IPv4 address,\n"
"or a resolvable DNS name."
msgstr ""
"連線到偏好設定中已啟用的所有網路。\n"
"也可以使用 IP:Port 格式指定伺服器，只連線到該伺服器。\n"
"位址必須是以句點分隔的十進位 IPv4 位址，\n"
"或可解析的 DNS 名稱。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Connect to eD2k only."
msgstr "只連線到 eD2k 網路。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Connect to Kad only."
msgstr "只連線到 Kad 網路。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Disconnect from the network."
msgstr "中斷網路連線。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "This will disconnect from all networks that are currently connected.\n"
msgstr "這將中斷目前所有已連線的網路。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Disconnect from eD2k only."
msgstr "只中斷 eD2k 連線。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Disconnect from Kad only."
msgstr "只中斷 Kad 連線。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Add an eD2k or magnet link to core."
msgstr "將 eD2k 或 magnet 連結新增到核心程式。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"The eD2k link to be added can be:\n"
"*) a file link (ed2k://|file|...), it will be added to the download queue,\n"
"*) a server link (ed2k://|server|...), it will be added to the server list,\n"
"*) or a serverlist link, in which case all servers in the list will be added to the\n"
"   server list.\n"
"\n"
"The magnet link must contain the eD2k hash and file length.\n"
msgstr ""
"可新增下列 eD2k 連結：\n"
"*) 檔案連結 (ed2k://|file|...) 會加入下載佇列。\n"
"*) 伺服器連結 (ed2k://|server|...) 會加入伺服器清單。\n"
"*) 伺服器清單連結會將連結中列出的所有伺服器\n"
"   加入伺服器清單。\n"
"\n"
"magnet 連結必須包含 eD2k 雜湊值和檔案大小。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Set a preference value."
msgstr "設定偏好設定值。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Set IP filtering preferences."
msgstr "調整 IP 過濾設定。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Turn IP filtering on for both clients and servers."
msgstr "啟用用戶端與伺服器的 IP 過濾。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Turn IP filtering off for both clients and servers."
msgstr "停用用戶端與伺服器的 IP 過濾。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Enable/Disable IP filtering for clients."
msgstr "啟用或停用用戶端的 IP 過濾。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Turn IP filtering on for clients."
msgstr "啟用用戶端的 IP 過濾。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Turn IP filtering off for clients."
msgstr "停用用戶端的 IP 過濾。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Enable/Disable IP filtering for servers."
msgstr "啟用或停用伺服器的 IP 過濾。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Turn IP filtering on for servers."
msgstr "啟用伺服器的 IP 過濾。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Turn IP filtering off for servers."
msgstr "停用對伺服器 IP 過濾。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Select IP filtering level."
msgstr "選取 IP 過濾等級。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"Valid filtering levels are in the range 0-255, and it's default (initial)\n"
"value is 127.\n"
msgstr ""
"有效的 IP 過濾等級是在 0 到 255 之間，\n"
"初始預設值是 127。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Set bandwidth limits."
msgstr "設定頻寬限制。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "The value given to these commands has to be in kilobytes/sec.\n"
msgstr "這些指令的數值一律使用 KiB/s。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Set upload bandwidth limit."
msgstr "設定上傳頻寬限制。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "The given value must be in kilobytes/sec.\n"
msgstr "數值的單位必須為 KiB/s。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Set download bandwidth limit."
msgstr "設定下載頻寬限制。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Enable or disable endgame source rotation."
msgstr "啟用或停用終局來源輪替。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "The given value must be 1/ON (enable) or 0/OFF (disable).\n"
msgstr "指定的值必須為 1/ON（啟用）或 0/OFF（停用）。\n"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Get and display a preference value."
msgstr "取得並顯示偏好設定值。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Get IP filtering preferences."
msgstr "取得 IP 過濾設定。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Get IP filtering state for both clients and servers."
msgstr "取得用戶端與伺服器的 IP 過濾狀態。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Get IP filtering state for clients only."
msgstr "只取得用戶端的 IP 過濾狀態。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Get IP filtering state for servers only."
msgstr "只取得對伺服器的 IP 過濾狀態。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Get IP filtering level."
msgstr "取得 IP 過濾等級。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Get bandwidth limits."
msgstr "取得頻寬限制。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Get endgame source rotation state."
msgstr "取得終局來源輪替狀態。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid "Execute a search."
msgstr "執行搜尋。"

#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"A search type has to be specified by giving the type:\n"
"    GLOBAL\n"
"    LOCAL\n"
"    KAD\n"
"    ALL: All networks (requires daemon support)\n"
"Example: 'search kad file' will execute a kad search for \"file\".\n"
"\n"
"Optional filters can be added before, after, or interleaved with\n"
"the search keyword(s):\n"
"    --type <Audio|Video|Image|Doc|Pro|Arc|Iso>\n"
"    --extension <ext>      (alias: --ext)\n"
"    --avail <N>            minimum number of sources\n"
"    --min-size <N[KMG]>    smallest file size; K=1024, M=K*1024, G=M*1024\n"
"    --max-size <N[KMG]>    largest file size; same suffixes\n"
"    --min-bitrate <kbps>   whole number, 0-1000000\n"
"    --min-duration <sec>   whole number, 0-86400\n"
"    --codec <text> --title <text> --album <text> --artist <text>\n"
"Quote media text values containing spaces.\n"
"Kad applies media filters; eD2k servers may ignore them.\n"
"Example: 'search global linux iso --type Iso --min-size 100M' returns\n"
"results for \"linux iso\" of file-type Iso at least 100 MiB.\n"
msgstr ""
"必須指定以下其中一種搜尋類型：\n"
"    GLOBAL\n"
"    LOCAL\n"
"    KAD\n"
"    ALL: 所有網路 (需背景服務支援)\n"
"例如 'search kad file' 會透過 Kad 搜尋 \"file\"。\n"
"\n"
"可在搜尋關鍵字之前、之後或之間\n"
"加入下列選用篩選條件：\n"
"    --type <Audio|Video|Image|Doc|Pro|Arc|Iso>\n"
"    --extension <ext>      (別名：--ext)\n"
"    --avail <N>            最少來源數\n"
"    --min-size <N[KMG]>    最小檔案大小，K=1024，M=K*1024，G=M*1024\n"
"    --max-size <N[KMG]>    最大檔案大小，使用相同的後綴\n"
"    --min-bitrate <kbps>   整數，範圍為 0-1000000\n"
"    --min-duration <sec>   整數，範圍為 0-86400\n"
"    --codec <text> --title <text> --album <text> --artist <text>\n"
"若媒體欄位的文字值含有空格，請加上引號。\n"
"Kad 會套用媒體篩選條件，eD2k 伺服器可能會忽略。\n"
"例如 'search global linux iso --type Iso --min-size 100M' 會傳回\n"
"「linux iso」的搜尋結果，檔案類型為 Iso，且至少有 100 MiB。\n"

