msgstr "無法移除舊版的 ECPassword，將在重新啟動時再次嘗試清除。"

#: src/libs/ec/cpp/ECSRPConfig.cpp
msgid "Could not persist ECPasswordVerifier; using the legacy ECPassword in memory for this run. Migration will be retried on restart."
msgstr "無法將 ECPasswordVerifier 寫入設定檔。本次執行將使用記憶體中的舊版 ECPassword，重新啟動時會再次嘗試移轉。"

#: src/libs/ec/cpp/ECSRPConfig.cpp
msgid "Could not generate ECPasswordVerifier; external connections are disabled."
msgstr "無法產生 ECPasswordVerifier，已停用外部連線。"

#: src/libs/ec/cpp/ECSRPConfig.cpp
msgid "EC password change rejected: could not generate ECPasswordVerifier. The active credential is unchanged."
msgstr "拒絕變更 EC 密碼：無法產生 ECPasswordVerifier。目前使用的驗證資料未變更。"

#: src/libs/ec/cpp/ECSRPConfig.cpp
msgid "EC password change rejected: could not persist ECPasswordVerifier. The active credential is unchanged."
msgstr "拒絕變更 EC 密碼：無法將 ECPasswordVerifier 寫入設定檔。目前使用的驗證資料未變更。"

#: src/libs/ec/cpp/ECSRPConfig.cpp
msgid "EC password change rejected: could not store ECPasswordVerifier. The active credential is unchanged."
msgstr "拒絕變更 EC 密碼：無法儲存 ECPasswordVerifier。目前使用的驗證資料未變更。"

#: src/libs/ec/cpp/ECSRPConfig.cpp
msgid "ECPassword contains an invalid or empty-password digest. Run amuled --set-ec-pass-stdin to set a new EC password."
msgstr "ECPassword 包含無效的摘要，或摘要對應空白密碼。請執行 amuled --set-ec-pass-stdin 設定新的 EC 密碼。"

#: src/libs/ec/cpp/ECSRPConfig.cpp
msgid "Invalid or unsupported ECPasswordVerifier; refusing external connections."
msgstr "ECPasswordVerifier 無效或不受支援，已拒絕外部連線。"

#: src/libs/ec/cpp/ECSRPConfig.cpp
msgid "Could not compare legacy ECPassword with ECPasswordVerifier; refusing external connections."
msgstr "無法比對舊版 ECPassword 和 ECPasswordVerifier，已拒絕外部連線。"

#: src/libs/ec/cpp/ECSRPConfig.cpp
msgid "Migrating a changed legacy ECPassword after downgrade; the previous verifier no longer authenticates this run."
msgstr "降版後的舊版 ECPassword 已變更，正在移轉。本次執行無法再使用先前的驗證資料通過驗證。"

